---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Legal title="Terms & Conditions" path="/terms">
  <p>
    These Terms &amp; Conditions ("Terms") govern your use of the IV Salt Rejuvenation website and services. By
    booking an appointment or using our website, you agree to these Terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Our Services</h2>
  <p>
    IV Salt Rejuvenation provides mobile IV hydration and wellness services. All IV therapies are administered by
    a licensed Registered Nurse under the supervision of a medical director, serving {site.serviceAreaShort}.
  </p>

  <h2>Not Medical Advice</h2>
  <p>
    Information on this website is for general informational purposes only and is not medical advice. IV therapy
    services are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Individual results may vary.
    Always consult your physician about your health, especially if you are pregnant, nursing, or have a medical
    condition.
  </p>

  <h2>Eligibility & Consent</h2>
  <p>
    You must be at least 18 years old to book. Before treatment, you must complete our medical screening and
    consent form. We reserve the right to decline or discontinue service if treatment is not appropriate for your
    health and safety, as determined by our clinical team.
  </p>

  <h2>Booking, Deposits & Payment</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your appointment is a <strong>request</strong> until confirmed. Confirmation requires completion of the
      consent form and payment of a <strong>${site.depositAmount} deposit</strong> (see our <a href="/cancellation">Cancellation Policy</a>).</li>
    <li>The deposit is applied toward your total treatment cost.</li>
    <li>Final pricing is confirmed by your nurse. Prices listed are estimates for the selected therapy and add-ons.</li>
    <li>Payment is due as arranged at or before your appointment.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cancellations & Rescheduling</h2>
  <p>
    If you need to cancel or reschedule, please contact us as early as possible at <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a> or <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. Deposit refund
    or transfer eligibility for late cancellations or missed appointments will be handled on a case-by-case basis.
  </p>

  <h2>Your Responsibilities</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Provide accurate contact, address, and health information.</li>
    <li>Ensure a safe, accessible environment for treatment at the service address you provide.</li>
    <li>Disclose all relevant health conditions, medications, and allergies.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Assumption of Risk & Limitation of Liability</h2>
  <p>
    IV therapy carries inherent risks that will be described in your consent form. To the fullest extent permitted
    by law, IV Salt Rejuvenation and its personnel are not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential
    damages arising from your use of the website or services. Nothing in these Terms limits liability that cannot
    be limited by law.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
  <p>
    All content on this website, including text, graphics, logos, and images, is owned by or licensed to IV Salt
    Rejuvenation and may not be used without permission.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing Law</h2>
  <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Florida, without regard to conflict-of-law principles.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of our website or services means you accept the updated Terms.</p>
</Legal>
